{
  "slug": "slide-revive",
  "name": "Slide Revive",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Rebuild NotebookLM slide PDFs as fully editable PPTX files using Vision AI.\n\nNotebookLM exports each slide as a flat image, making text and shapes impossible to edit. slide-revive extracts each page, analyzes it with Claude Vision, reconstructs the slide structure with native text boxes, tables, and shapes, and generates a polished .pptx alongside an instant .html preview — all in one command. No external API key required. Supports macOS and Windows.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 commands** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Commands** (2): `analyze` (PDFをVision AIで解析してspec.yamlを生成する（PPTX生成はしない）), `convert` (NotebookLMのPDF出力を編集可能なPPTX+HTMLとして再構築する)\n- **Hooks** (1): `hooks.json`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install slide-revive@claude-community` from `yn01/claude-plugins` (`plugins/slide-revive`).\n\nRebuild NotebookLM slide PDFs as fully editable PPTX files using Vision AI.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "hook": 1,
    "command": 2
  },
  "sourceType": "community",
